WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:59.753 --> 00:02:00.754
Cleao...

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.391
how is my master?

00:02:04.391 --> 00:02:06.360
There's no "how" or "what" about it.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.362
He's been just like that forever.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.465
He says, "Sorry, but leave me alone."

00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:16.236
Really! When people are worrying! How rude!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.939
It was a shock.

00:02:18.939 --> 00:02:23.877
Even using that bracelet,
he couldn't bind Bloody August.

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:28.015
| wish he'd talk about everything.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:32.386
Stop holding it all in his heart.

00:02:32.953 --> 00:02:34.221
That's true.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:37.624
Sometimes when you talk about it,
you feel better.

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.399
Azalie...

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:51.772
the secret of the
heavenly beast: SORCERESS

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.689
What are you thinking, Hartia?

00:03:10.057 --> 00:03:11.458
Master Childman...

00:03:12.059 --> 00:03:13.927
Is it about Krylancelo?

00:03:14.428 --> 00:03:17.297
Yes, because he was my friend.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:22.369
Azalie's funeral was on
a day like this, wasn't it?

00:03:22.369 --> 00:03:24.471
The light of the setting sun
was the color of blood.

00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:28.008
They were excellent sorcerers.

00:03:28.008 --> 00:03:29.910
Both Azalie and Krylancelo.

00:03:30.544 --> 00:03:33.880
They would have risen to
quite a high level by now...

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:38.418
had that incident not occurred.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:00.807
You're in very high spirits,
aren't you, Big Brother?

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:02.476
Of course,

00:04:02.476 --> 00:04:06.546
because that lousy sorcerer
is down in the dumps.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:10.851
So, when the sorcerer's depressed,
you get in a better mood?

00:04:10.851 --> 00:04:12.686
Exactamento!

00:04:12.686 --> 00:04:15.756
His misery is happiness for wonderful me!

00:04:15.756 --> 00:04:18.692
The more his sky darkens, the richer I get!

00:04:18.692 --> 00:04:25.866
| feel great! The money comes
rolling in, no mistake!

00:04:26.066 --> 00:04:29.102
So the reverse is if you
are miserable, Big Brother,

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.705
then that sorcerer will get happy?

00:04:32.806 --> 00:04:34.608
Don't say such unlucky things!

00:04:37.811 --> 00:04:38.979
Look at that.

00:04:38.979 --> 00:04:41.047
It's the Aligena Coat of Arms.

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.315
There's no mistaking it!

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:45.152
The treasure room is over there!

00:04:54.427 --> 00:04:56.229
Amazing!

00:05:02.836 --> 00:05:08.542
Stupid Orphen, he won't eat the meal
| put my heart and soul into!

00:05:08.542 --> 00:05:10.110
It makes me so mad!

00:05:10.477 --> 00:05:12.679
Sometimes it's just like that.

00:05:14.748 --> 00:05:17.117
Really! Whenever it's something
about that Azalie person,

00:05:17.117 --> 00:05:19.820
he gets so depressed all of a sudden.

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.355
It doesn't make any sense at alll Really!

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:27.627
Ms. Azalie must be a very important
person to my master.

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.102
What happened?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.072
Th-that!

00:05:52.619 --> 00:05:54.387
Wh-what is this?

00:05:58.158 --> 00:06:00.727
This is a Heavenly Beings' crystal!

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:02.262
A Heavenly Beings' crystal?

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:05.031
| read about it in a geology book.

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.800
Oh, that means...

00:06:10.237 --> 00:06:12.272
Could it be? This person is...

00:06:13.106 --> 00:06:14.307
Master!

00:06:14.608 --> 00:06:16.243
Master!

00:06:33.193 --> 00:06:34.761
A-Azalie!

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.797
| thought so.

00:06:38.064 --> 00:06:40.700
This person is Ms. Azalie?

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.135
Why is she here?

00:06:42.469 --> 00:06:44.304
That's not it, Cleao.

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:47.908
This isn't the real Ms. Azalie.

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:55.582
| remember now!

00:06:55.582 --> 00:07:01.221
Heavenly Beings' crystals
pass light extremely slowly.

00:07:01.221 --> 00:07:02.689
What's that mean?

00:07:02.689 --> 00:07:06.960
In other words, for the scene on
the other side to reach our eyes,

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.597
it may take months, even years.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.432
Then this is...

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:17.938
Yes, what we're looking at is the Ms. Azalie
who entered this room six years ago.

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:21.574
That's...

00:07:48.268 --> 00:07:49.269
Master!

00:07:49.269 --> 00:07:50.437
Orphen!

00:08:26.006 --> 00:08:27.207
Why?

00:08:28.008 --> 00:08:30.343
Why did it turn out like this?

00:08:45.225 --> 00:08:49.129
If only I had more power...

00:08:57.871 --> 00:08:59.105
Tears?

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:04.577
Master, please tell us about it, all of it.

00:09:05.145 --> 00:09:08.548
| can't bear to watch you suffer alone, Master.

00:09:09.315 --> 00:09:14.988
Not that I can do anything more
than listen, but I want to help!

00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:20.593
Orphen...

00:09:22.195 --> 00:09:23.396
Here...

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:30.370
Sorry, until just now, she was in the reflection.

00:09:43.483 --> 00:09:46.152
| thought about it.

00:09:46.553 --> 00:09:50.723
What if my mother or big sister
became a monster?

00:09:51.891 --> 00:09:54.794
It'd be hard. It'd be sad.

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:57.163
I'd probably cry and cry,

00:09:57.163 --> 00:09:59.799
but I think that I would have to
try and save them.

00:09:59.799 --> 00:10:03.069
After all, I love my mother and my big sister!

00:10:05.538 --> 00:10:08.875
Orphen, you loved her too, right?
That person called Azalie?

00:10:25.558 --> 00:10:27.727
We were both orphans.

00:10:29.529 --> 00:10:32.732
Azalie and I were raised at the same orphanage.

00:10:34.134 --> 00:10:35.068
Orphen...

00:10:35.068 --> 00:10:38.972
Then we passed through the gate to
the Tower of Fangs on the same day.

00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:18.745
They believed we had the promise of great magic.

00:11:19.445 --> 00:11:21.347
We were apprenticed sixteen years ago.

00:11:21.347 --> 00:11:25.652
| was four and Azalie was nine.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.268
Krylancelo!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.038
Krylancelo!

00:11:47.307 --> 00:11:48.608
Krylancelo!

00:11:58.818 --> 00:12:00.553
| said Krylancelo!

00:12:01.454 --> 00:12:03.523
Azalie, what's up?

00:12:04.257 --> 00:12:06.259
Don't you "What's up?" me!

00:12:06.492 --> 00:12:08.127
Here. This.

00:12:08.928 --> 00:12:10.863
Oh, my bad!

00:12:10.863 --> 00:12:13.132
It shows you're not concentrating enough,

00:12:13.132 --> 00:12:15.134
when you forget this on the day of your exam!

00:12:15.468 --> 00:12:16.869
Thank you.

00:12:17.337 --> 00:12:19.706
Krylancelo's so lucky!

00:12:19.706 --> 00:12:21.608
He's always with Azalie!

00:12:21.608 --> 00:12:23.309
It's not like that.

00:12:23.309 --> 00:12:26.412
He's just like a brother to Azalie.

00:12:26.646 --> 00:12:28.281
Is that so, Hartia?

00:12:28.281 --> 00:12:29.182
Who knows?

00:12:32.051 --> 00:12:33.186
Oh, no!

00:12:33.553 --> 00:12:35.955
Master Childman will scold us if we're late.

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:36.990
Shall we go then?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:37.991
S-sure.

00:12:38.825 --> 00:12:40.026
We're late!

00:12:40.026 --> 00:12:41.694
Hurry up!

00:12:43.229 --> 00:12:48.935
At the Tower of Fangs, she was the
idol of kids learning black magic.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:54.240
She was headstrong, intelligent, and beautiful.

00:12:55.141 --> 00:12:59.779
Come to think of it, I may have been one of them.

00:13:15.862 --> 00:13:19.098
People called Azalie
"Sorceress of the Heavenly Beast."

00:13:19.732 --> 00:13:23.703
She was the most advanced sorceress
ever seen in the Tower of Fangs.

00:13:24.037 --> 00:13:26.706
Even to me, she was an idol.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:28.808
0O, thunder!

00:13:28.975 --> 00:13:30.076
0O, thunder!

00:13:42.955 --> 00:13:44.624
Wow! Good going, Azalie!

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:49.529
Azalie, don't get so big headed.

00:13:51.831 --> 00:13:54.967
Krylancelo, you rely on your genius too much.

00:13:55.435 --> 00:13:58.438
As with any gem, it will not shine
unless you polish it.

00:13:58.438 --> 00:13:59.939
Y-yes...

00:14:00.573 --> 00:14:02.075
That's all for today.

00:14:02.475 --> 00:14:04.310
Thank you very much!

00:14:05.912 --> 00:14:07.714
Don't get so down.

00:14:08.147 --> 00:14:09.048
Azalie...

00:14:09.615 --> 00:14:12.518
After all, you're five years younger than me.

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:14.153
It's only normal that you can't do it.

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:15.755
Now, aren't you a boy?

00:14:16.055 --> 00:14:17.724
Cheer up now! Cheer up!

00:14:21.994 --> 00:14:24.997
Azalie and I were always together.

00:14:24.997 --> 00:14:29.836
During training, meals, and even holidays,
just like blood related siblings.

00:14:30.169 --> 00:14:31.904
We were close.

00:14:33.239 --> 00:14:37.577
| don't agree with having to
cut my hair short at all.

00:14:38.044 --> 00:14:39.912
The Tower of Fangs is so strict!

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:42.882
I think it'd look good on you short!

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:48.020
Flattery? You've grown, haven't you?

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:50.289
It's not flattery! It's true! For real!

00:14:51.724 --> 00:14:52.992
Thank you.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:15.481
| liked to see my image reflected in Azalie's eyes.

00:15:16.082 --> 00:15:20.453
It made me feel as though I could
become a strong sorcerer like her.

00:15:28.428 --> 00:15:32.432
You always act like you're
just waiting to be thrown!

00:15:35.601 --> 00:15:37.103
Now, get up!

00:15:38.905 --> 00:15:43.743
But sometimes I thought Azalie was frightening.

00:15:49.649 --> 00:15:54.120
She had an almost fanatical
preoccupation with magical studies.

00:15:54.687 --> 00:15:57.523
| thought it might one day be her downfall.

00:15:59.058 --> 00:16:00.560
Say, Krylancelo.

00:16:02.562 --> 00:16:04.063
Can you read this?

00:16:06.265 --> 00:16:09.569
They're the same as the ones
on the sword we unearthed.

00:16:10.036 --> 00:16:12.538
It's impossible for me.
If you can't read them,

00:16:12.538 --> 00:16:14.607
there's no way I could.

00:16:15.074 --> 00:16:17.109
Don't say such undependable things.

00:16:17.109 --> 00:16:19.512
After all, you're about to become my assistant.

00:16:19.512 --> 00:16:20.446
Assistant?!

00:16:20.947 --> 00:16:23.916
Your most recent test results
place you at the head of your class.

00:16:23.916 --> 00:16:25.218
It's almost certain.

00:16:25.718 --> 00:16:26.752
Really?!

00:16:26.752 --> 00:16:31.190
So, put some effort into
magical runes too, okay? Please?

00:16:32.391 --> 00:16:34.594
| have one more thing I want to ask you, but...

00:16:34.594 --> 00:16:35.728
What?

00:16:35.728 --> 00:16:39.098
After you eat, can you come here again?

00:16:39.098 --> 00:16:43.169
| want to do an experiment with ancient magic,
without letting the elders know.

00:16:43.169 --> 00:16:44.070
Please assist me?

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.304
Okay!

00:16:45.872 --> 00:16:49.609
That became the last smile
I'd ever see from Azalie.

00:16:53.646 --> 00:16:55.882
Then the tragedy occurred.

00:17:00.453 --> 00:17:01.420
Azalie!

00:17:09.028 --> 00:17:09.996
Azalie!

00:17:10.263 --> 00:17:12.031
What's wrong, Azalie?

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:13.499
Don't come in!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.636
Please, don't come in.

00:17:17.336 --> 00:17:19.205
Don't come in, Krylancelo!

00:17:20.006 --> 00:17:23.476
That's the Sword of Baltanders.

00:17:24.377 --> 00:17:29.248
You didn't try to test the magic of
the sword on your own body?!

00:17:41.861 --> 00:17:43.296
Krylancelo...

00:18:29.942 --> 00:18:33.112
To use your own magic to become a monster!

00:18:33.112 --> 00:18:35.748
This is the first scandal since
the inception of the Tower of Fangs.

00:18:35.748 --> 00:18:37.984
Should word of this become widespread,

00:18:37.984 --> 00:18:41.554
it will affect the honor of
the Tower of Fangs. It will fall!

00:18:41.787 --> 00:18:46.325
We will erase the stain,
by whatever methods necessary.

00:18:46.325 --> 00:18:49.261
Kill the Heavenly Beast Sorceress!

00:19:23.329 --> 00:19:24.397
Krylancelo!

00:19:24.697 --> 00:19:25.865
What are you doing?!

00:19:26.232 --> 00:19:28.367
Whose funeral is this?

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:31.237
It's Azalie's funeral, Krylancelo.

00:19:31.237 --> 00:19:33.806
It's a lie! She's alive!

00:19:33.806 --> 00:19:35.808
This coffin is empty!

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:41.180
| believe she died,
at least the sorceress Azalie did.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.949
The only ones who think so
are the ones in charge

00:19:43.949 --> 00:19:45.718
who worry about honor and prestige!

00:19:45.718 --> 00:19:47.219
| know!

00:19:47.219 --> 00:19:51.157
You guys fear a stain on
the name of the Tower of Fangs,

00:19:51.157 --> 00:19:53.192
and are planning to assassinate Azalie!

00:19:53.859 --> 00:19:55.027
Assassinate?

00:19:55.261 --> 00:19:57.396
She isn't a stain!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.632
If you want a funeral so bad,

00:19:59.632 --> 00:20:02.368
then I'll give you something
to put inside the coffin!

00:20:02.702 --> 00:20:04.270
Don't do it, Krylancelo!

00:20:04.537 --> 00:20:08.340
Bury my name with Azalie!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:12.278
I'll find her, and then I'll save her!

00:20:12.278 --> 00:20:14.013
How do you plan to save her?

00:20:14.013 --> 00:20:14.847
What?

00:20:15.181 --> 00:20:16.949
If there was such a way,

00:20:16.949 --> 00:20:19.051
then do you not think that
| would have already done so?

00:20:19.251 --> 00:20:21.787
Shut up! Even if you can't do it,

00:20:21.787 --> 00:20:25.758
| promise I'll change Azalie
back to her former self!

00:20:25.758 --> 00:20:26.792
Krylancelo!

00:20:26.992 --> 00:20:29.028
Krylancelo just died!

00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:34.867
As of today, I am Orphen!

00:20:39.605 --> 00:20:42.475
And that is how I began my journey.

00:20:42.708 --> 00:20:46.512
| threw away my name, my friends,
and the Tower of Fangs.

00:20:46.512 --> 00:20:50.049
To save Azalie, I became Orphen.

00:20:58.224 --> 00:20:59.992
The sun's come up?

00:21:01.794 --> 00:21:03.896
Are you crying, Cleao?

00:21:03.896 --> 00:21:05.564
Does it seem like I am?

00:21:06.766 --> 00:21:08.534
It's just cold. Cold!

00:21:09.001 --> 00:21:12.805
We don't have time to be depressed
or crying, right, Orphen?

00:21:15.808 --> 00:21:18.944
Now, let's head out! To save Azalie!

00:21:19.545 --> 00:21:20.813
Cleao...

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.082
But where are we going?

00:21:23.082 --> 00:21:24.950
How are we going to find Ms. Azalie?

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.519
Something'll come up!

00:21:26.519 --> 00:21:28.354
Isn't that right, Orphen? Am I wrong?

00:21:30.523 --> 00:21:33.559
Aren't you a man?
Cheer up now! Cheer up!

00:21:36.262 --> 00:21:37.963
I'm hungry.

00:21:37.963 --> 00:21:40.800
Sorry, but could you warm up that stew?

00:21:45.938 --> 00:21:47.706
| wonder if it's really true?

00:21:47.706 --> 00:21:51.610
If Big Brother gets miserable,
then the sorcerer cheers up.

00:21:54.013 --> 00:21:55.347
Here, Orphen!

00:21:56.282 --> 00:21:59.218
Thank you, Cleao, Majic.

00:22:09.728 --> 00:22:14.700
Next orphen

00:22:14.967 --> 00:22:17.603
In Alenhatan, the city of canals
and historic ruins,

00:22:17.603 --> 00:22:20.606
| meet my old partner, Stephanie.

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:23.008
But something isn't right.

00:22:23.209 --> 00:22:25.444
What? Golems in the canals?

00:22:25.444 --> 00:22:28.247
To top it off, Dortin and Volcan
are controlling them?!

00:22:28.247 --> 00:22:32.151
Looks like we're stuck in
another fishy incident.

00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:34.720
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:36.722
Partner I the CIty Of canals
"Partner in the City of Canals."

00:22:36.722 --> 00:22:39.291
PARTNER 1IN the CIty of canals
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

